    {
      "id": "overview",
      "title": "Overview",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Romanticism: individual expression, nationalism, expanded orchestra, programme music."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "composers",
      "title": "Composers",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Chopin, Schumann, Liszt, Brahms, Wagner, Tchaikovsky, Mahler. Symphonies grow to 80+ minutes."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nationalism",
      "title": "Nationalism",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Folk melodies in concert works legitimised oral tradition for middle-class audiences."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "virtuosity",
      "title": "Virtuosity",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Paganini, Liszt — performer-composers as celebrities. Virtuoso tradition continues in trad festival competition."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
